@startuml UserWorkflowSequence
title User Workflow Sequence

actor User
participant UI
participant ProjectStorage as "Project / Inventory Storage"
participant CalculationService as "Calculation Service"
participant RunStore as "CalculationRun Store"
participant ResultStore as "CalculationResult Store"

== Save draft ==
User -> UI : Edit setup / inventory
UI -> ProjectStorage : Save current Inventory(status=draft)
ProjectStorage --> UI : Draft saved

== Calculate ==
User -> UI : Trigger calculate
UI -> CalculationService : Calculate current Inventory
CalculationService -> RunStore : Create CalculationRun
RunStore --> CalculationService : calculationRunId
CalculationService -> ResultStore : Create CalculationResult
ResultStore --> CalculationService : calculationResultId
CalculationService -> ProjectStorage : Update Inventory(status=calculated, lockedYears, latestCalculationRunId)
ProjectStorage --> UI : Calculated Inventory
UI --> User : Show calculated result

== Add years ==
User -> UI : Add new years in setup
UI -> ProjectStorage : Create / update current Inventory as draft
note right of ProjectStorage
Previously calculated years remain locked.
Only new years become editable.
end note
ProjectStorage --> UI : Draft Inventory with new years

== Recalculate ==
User -> UI : Trigger calculate for updated Inventory
UI -> CalculationService : Calculate current Inventory
CalculationService -> RunStore : Create CalculationRun
RunStore --> CalculationService : calculationRunId
CalculationService -> ResultStore : Create CalculationResult
ResultStore --> CalculationService : calculationResultId
CalculationService -> ProjectStorage : Update Inventory(status=calculated, latestCalculationRunId)
ProjectStorage --> UI : Updated calculated Inventory
UI --> User : Show updated result

@enduml
